WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:05.880
From "Poker Face" to "Joker Face"! Lady&nbsp;
Gaga gave her Little Monsters a sneak peek&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:10.920
of her Harley Quinn in the upcoming "Joker"&nbsp;
sequel, and the reaction was fantabulous.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:16.740
Harley Quinn is easily one of the most dynamic&nbsp;
characters in DC's extensive roster of heroes and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:22.546
baddies, and plenty of stars have taken a crack at&nbsp;
playing the unstable and heavily armed villainess.

00:00:22.783 --> 00:00:25.736
"Don't worry, I'm over the crime thing, see?"

00:00:27.038 --> 00:00:31.140
Margot Robbie notably debuted her&nbsp;
portrayal of Dr. Harleen Quinzel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:36.000
in 2016's "Suicide Squad." She later&nbsp;
reprised the role in both "Birds of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.200
Prey" and James Gunn's half-sequel,&nbsp;
half-do-over, "The Suicide Squad."

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.500
"You're a hero to me, as well as to my&nbsp;
people." "I think you might got me confused."

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:51.000
At the same time, Kaley Cuoco&nbsp;
began voicing an animated version&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.320
of the character in 2019 for the&nbsp;
"Harley Quinn" TV series. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.000
Lady Gaga is stepping up to the plate to play&nbsp;
Quinn in Todd Phillips' sequel to "Joker."

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.160
Starring Joaquin Phoenix in an Oscar-winning&nbsp;
performance as Arthur Fleck, "Joker" tracked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:10.560
the origins of how a wannabe comedian became an&nbsp;
iconic supervillain. With its heady hallucinations&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:15.960
and choreographed dance sequences, "Joker" had&nbsp;
a bit of the spirit of Lady Gaga's stylized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:20.820
and surreal brand of artistry. So it made&nbsp;
sense when the pop star took to Twitter in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:27.420
August 2022 to confirm her involvement in the&nbsp;
upcoming sequel, titled "Joker: Folie à Deux".

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:32.400
With "Folie à Deux" set to be a musical,&nbsp;
Lady Gaga is arguably a top tier choice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:36.540
to play its Harley Quinn. Even Margot&nbsp;
Robbie endorsed the casting decision,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:40.734
noting that Quinn is an enduring&nbsp;
character, open to interpretation.

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:46.980
On February 14th, 2023, Gaga tweeted out a&nbsp;
first-look preview image of herself as Quinn.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:51.660
In it, Gaga's character is staring&nbsp;
awestruck at Phoenix's Arthur with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:56.820
some clown makeup smudged on her face, as she&nbsp;
clasps his head in her hands. Unsurprisingly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.820 --> 00:02:01.080
no one is as excited to see Gaga morph&nbsp;
into the villain as her devoted fans.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:05.940
Given the date of its release, Gaga's army&nbsp;
of Little Monsters received this photo as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:10.500
Valentine's Day treat, and needless&nbsp;
to say, fire emojis, heart emojis,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:15.360
and gasps of "Mother!" were plentiful&nbsp;
in her Twitter replies. One fan posted,

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:19.860
"No trailer, No plot, No character&nbsp;
description. Just one Lady Gaga&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.580
shot on the 'Joker' set that has&nbsp;
everyone moving. That's impact."

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:28.800
Other users are even hoping that Gaga's&nbsp;
multi-hyphenate talents will earn her first Oscar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:34.560
acting nomination since 2018's "A Star Is Born,"&nbsp;
cementing her status as a Hollywood powerhouse.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:38.760
On Reddit too, among users of the&nbsp;
DC cinematic universe subreddit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:44.640
responses are largely positive to this first photo&nbsp;
of the pop superstar as Harley Quinn. For example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.000
in a thread dedicated to her&nbsp;
preview image, one user wrote,

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.686
"Lady Gaga can bring the weird energy,&nbsp;
so I think this should be pretty rad."

00:02:52.686 --> 00:02:57.960
This comment alone received more than 600&nbsp;
upvotes. Similarly, another user argued that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:01.800
good chemistry is already apparent&nbsp;
between Gaga and Joaquin Phoenix.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:06.000
Meanwhile, users of a general pop&nbsp;
culture discussion subreddit are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.080
likewise stoked about Gaga as Quinn.&nbsp;
One user posted about the image,

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:15.840
"I don't think I was sold on her as Harley until&nbsp;
this. Her whole face embodies the character wow,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.460
I'm actually getting excited for this one now."

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:23.040
Fans will have to wait a little while longer&nbsp;
to see Gaga transform into Quinn on the big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:29.475
screen, however. "Joker: Folie à Deux" is&nbsp;
scheduled for release on October 4, 2024.

